{"title":"**Welcome**","markdown":{"headingText":"**Welcome**","containsRefs":false,"markdown":"\n**Welcome to Sifti Ghar – Where Nature Meets Culture**  \n\n*If deserts (sand) can attract tourists, why not the lush green farm landscapes of Punjab?*  \n\nAt **Sifti Ghar**, we invite you to escape the chaos of city life and immerse yourself in the serene beauty of rural Punjab. Experience the charm of agro-ecotourism, where breathtaking farm landscapes, authentic culture, and hands-on farming activities come together to create unforgettable memories.  \n\n\n### **Discover Sifti Ghar**  \nSifti Ghar is more than just a destination – it’s a journey into the heart of Punjab’s agricultural heritage. Our project is designed to bring the farm life of Punjab to life, offering visitors a unique blend of relaxation, education, and adventure.  \n\n- **Experience Authentic Rural Punjab** – Explore working farms, lush fields, and traditional Punjabi culture.  \n- **Try Your Hand at Farming** – Get involved in farm activities and connect with the land.  \n- **Savor Organic Delights** – Enjoy fresh, organic produce straight from our farms.  \n- **Celebrate Local Traditions** – Participate in vibrant festivals and cultural events.  \n\n\n\n### **Our Mission**  \nAt Sifti Ghar, our mission is to bridge the gap between people and nature. We aim to foster a deep appreciation for agriculture, sustainability, and the beauty of rural life. Through education, entertainment, and hands-on experiences, we create a welcoming space for learning, adventure, and connection.  \n\n**Our Core Values**:  \n- **Sustainability** – Protecting and preserving the environment.  \n- **Community** – Celebrating and supporting local culture and traditions.  \n- **Education** – Inspiring a love for agriculture and the natural world.  \n\n\n\n### **Explore Nearby Attractions**  \nSifti Ghar is perfectly located near some of Punjab’s most iconic landmarks:  \n- **Attari-Wagha Border** (The Famous International Border with Pakistan) – Just 200 meters away.  \n- **Golden Temple, Amritsar** – 32 KM  \n- **Durgiana Mandir, Amritsar** – 28 KM  \n- **Gobindgarh Fort, Amritsar** – 28 KM  \n- **Jallianwala Bagh** – 32 KM  \n- **Sham Singh Attari Museum, Attari** – 3 KM  \n- **Pul Kanjri** – 7 KM  \n- **Punjab State War Heroes’ Memorial & Museum** – 19 KM  \n\n\n\n### **Plan Your Visit**  \nReady to experience the tranquility and charm of rural Punjab? Book your stay at Sifti Ghar today and embark on a journey that will rejuvenate your mind, body, and soul.  \n","srcMarkdownNoYaml":""},"formats":{"html":{"identifier":{"display-name":"HTML","target-format":"html","base-format":"html"},"execute":{"fig-width":7,"fig-height":5,"fig-format":"retina","fig-dpi":96,"df-print":"default","error":false,"eval":true,"cache":true,"freeze":true,"echo":true,"output":true,"warning":true,"include":true,"keep-md":false,"keep-ipynb":false,"ipynb":null,"enabled":null,"daemon":null,"daemon-restart":false,"debug":false,"ipynb-filters":[],"ipynb-shell-interactivity":null,"plotly-connected":true,"increment":true,"engine":"markdown"},"render":{"keep-tex":false,"keep-typ":false,"keep-source":false,"keep-hidden":false,"prefer-html":false,"output-divs":true,"output-ext":"html","fig-align":"default","fig-pos":null,"fig-env":null,"code-fold":"none","code-overflow":"scroll","code-link":false,"code-line-numbers":false,"code-tools":false,"tbl-colwidths":"auto","merge-includes":true,"inline-includes":false,"preserve-yaml":false,"latex-auto-mk":true,"latex-auto-install":true,"latex-clean":true,"latex-min-runs":1,"latex-max-runs":10,"latex-makeindex":"makeindex","latex-makeindex-opts":[],"latex-tlmgr-opts":[],"latex-input-paths":[],"latex-output-dir":null,"link-external-icon":false,"link-external-newwindow":false,"self-contained-math":false,"format-resources":[],"notebook-links":true},"pandoc":{"standalone":true,"wrap":"none","default-image-extension":"png","to":"html","output-file":"index.html"},"language":{"toc-tit